Abinova bundled thesaurus
=========================

th_en_US_v2.idx / th_en_US_v2.dat form a standard MyThes
(OpenOffice/LibreOffice) thesaurus pair, reduced to the words that
occur in this repository's documentation and the development docx
corpus plus a seeded list of everyday vocabulary (~2 800 words vs
the ~146 000 in the full upstream file).

Lookup order at runtime (UT_Thesaurus::forLanguage):

    $ABINOVA_THESAURUS_DIR
    /usr/share/mythes, /usr/share/hunspell, /usr/share/myspell,
    /usr/local/share/mythes, ~/.local/share/mythes
    <AbiSuiteLibDir>/thesaurus   (this directory — fallback)

Any full MyThes pair dropped into one of the system dirs is used
instead of this reduced copy.

Regenerate:

    tools/mkthesaurus.py            # needs system mythes-en-us

Provenance: libreoffice-dictionaries "en" thesaurus word lists,
